1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,720
I just woke up from my nap what time is it oh my gosh it's 4 00 p m.
我刚午睡醒来。几点了？天哪，已经下午四点了。

2
00:00:05,720 --> 00:00:12,199
Normally during this time if I don't take a nap on the couch or in my bed then I'll be running errands.
通常这个时候，如果我没在沙发上或床上睡午觉，就会在外面办些杂事。

3
00:00:12,199 --> 00:00:15,959
So I might go to the store to get something that I need for my house.
所以我可能会去商店买家里需要的东西。

4
00:00:15,959 --> 00:00:23,040
Or I might be doing some household chores like watering my plants cleaning up the living room vacuuming.
或者我会做些家务，比如浇花、收拾客厅、吸尘。

5
00:00:23,040 --> 00:00:28,720
Or even doing things for my personal life like visiting my father and visiting my friends.
或者处理私人生活中的事，比如去看爸爸、去看朋友。

6
00:00:28,720 --> 00:00:33,839
So basically people can run errands during this time or they can do their favorite hobbies.
所以基本上，这个时候人们可以跑腿办事，也可以做自己喜欢的兴趣活动。

7
00:00:33,839 --> 00:00:41,000
But honestly this time depends on each person person for example some people might still be working at this time.
但说实话，这个时间段的安排因人而异。比如，有些人这时可能还在工作。

8
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:45,319
Or some people might be getting up to go to work for a night shift.
或者有些人可能刚起床，准备去上夜班。

9
00:00:45,319 --> 00:00:50,399
Right now I finished everything with work I don't have to run any errands.
现在，我已经完成所有工作，也不用出去办杂事了。

10
00:00:50,399 --> 00:00:55,280
So I don't have to buy anything for my pets I don't have to stop by the grocery store.
所以我不需要给宠物买东西，也不用顺路去食品杂货店。

11
00:00:55,280 --> 00:01:01,360
But during this time today it's really nice outside so I'll take a walk with my dog once again.
不过今天这个时候外面天气很好，所以我会再带狗出去散步。

12
00:01:01,360 --> 00:01:05,640
And we're going to go to the park and then we're going to get some ice cream.
我们要去公园，然后买点冰淇淋。

13
00:01:16,720 --> 00:01:24,199
During the summertime there's many activities you can do during the day for example you can go to a soccer game.
夏天白天有很多可以做的活动，比如去看足球赛。

14
00:01:24,199 --> 00:01:29,680
A baseball game you can go to the pool or you can even discover new hobbies.
还可以去看棒球赛、去游泳池，甚至发现新的爱好。

15
00:01:29,680 --> 00:01:34,790
Some of my hobbies include playing sports I enjoy playing volleyball and pickle ball.
我的一些爱好包括运动。我喜欢打排球和匹克球。

16
00:01:34,800 --> 00:01:40,480
Right now I don't have any games to play pickle ball or volleyball so that's why I'm here at the park.
现在我没有匹克球或排球比赛可以打，所以我来公园了。

17
00:01:40,480 --> 00:01:43,839
Let me know down below in the comments your favorite hobby.
在下面的评论里告诉我，你最喜欢的爱好是什么。

18
00:01:43,839 --> 00:01:51,600
Right now it's nighttime it's dark out and I just ate dinner and I normally eat around 88 or 900 p m.
现在是晚上，外面黑了，我刚吃过晚饭。我通常在晚上“88 or 900”左右吃饭。

19
00:01:51,600 --> 00:01:57,759
I kind of like to eat a late dinner and then after dinner I like to wind down and watch some tv.
我算是喜欢晚一点吃饭。晚饭后，我喜欢放松下来，看会儿电视。

20
00:01:57,759 --> 00:02:04,680
I like to watch some youtube some netflix hulu any kind of show or movie I really like to relax.
我喜欢看 YouTube、Netflix、Hulu，各种节目或电影。我很喜欢放松。

21
00:02:04,680 --> 00:02:09,600
Also when I wind down I also like to scroll on my phone so I'll go on instagram.
放松的时候，我也喜欢刷手机，所以我会上 Instagram。

22
00:02:09,600 --> 00:02:13,920
Tik tok facebook and I'll watch videos funny videos like memes.
还有 TikTok、Facebook，看看视频，像表情包那样的搞笑视频。

23
00:02:13,920 --> 00:02:19,920
But sometimes I don't want to watch any tv or even go on my phone so I like to read a book.
不过有时我不想看电视，也不想玩手机，那我就喜欢读本书。

24
00:02:19,920 --> 00:02:26,240
I even like to play with my dog or my cat that way I can just relax and just kind of disconnect from the world for a little bit.
我还喜欢和狗或猫玩，这样就能放松一下，暂时和外界断开联系。

25
00:02:26,240 --> 00:02:35,440
I was watching a movie on the tv sorry for my yawn but I think it's getting late and now I need to get ready to go to bed.
我刚才在电视上看电影。不好意思，打了个哈欠；我想时间不早了，现在得准备睡觉。

26
00:02:35,440 --> 00:02:43,839
So before going to bed and then falling asleep I need to change my clothes from my regular clothes into pajamas or pjs.
上床、睡着之前，我得把平时的衣服换成睡衣，也就是 pjs。

27
00:02:43,839 --> 00:02:50,600
And then I need to remove my makeup wash my face moisturize do my skin care brush my teeth.
然后我要卸妆、洗脸、保湿、护肤、刷牙。

28
00:02:50,600 --> 00:02:55,680
Brush my hair take out my contacts because I wear contacts in my eyes.
梳头、摘隐形眼镜，因为我戴隐形眼镜。

29
00:02:55,680 --> 00:03:02,639
And then I'll be ready to go to bed but before going to bed I still need to take out my dog on a walk.
之后我就可以上床了。不过上床之前，我还得带狗出去散步。

30
00:03:02,639 --> 00:03:09,550
So he doesn't pee or poop inside my apartment and I probably have I've taken him out like five or six times a day.
这样它就不会在公寓里大小便。我大概已经……一天带它出去五六次。

31
00:03:09,560 --> 00:03:14,959
Right now it's almost 11 00 and it's time to get in bed.
现在快十一点了，该上床睡觉了。

32
00:03:14,959 --> 00:03:22,000
I'm sitting on the bed but I am getting in bed by pulling the covers up.
我现在是坐在床上；把被子拉上来，就算钻进被窝了。

33
00:03:22,000 --> 00:03:28,199
And before I fall asleep I will set an alarm for 8 00 a m on my watch.
睡着之前，我会在手表上设一个早上八点的闹钟。

34
00:03:28,199 --> 00:03:32,079
That way I can do my daily routine all over again tomorrow.
这样明天就能重新开始我的日常安排了。

35
00:03:32,079 --> 00:03:36,680
